 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "From your hills, my son.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The boy who brought it walked like a man used to stones, not sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He eats too fast. That is how I know he comes from a place where grain is a worry.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Bad news?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Mixed. Which is the only kind that travels far.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Your people live.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. For now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And the men who rule your hills?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They grow sharper. And more divided.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Sharp and divided. Dangerous combination.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RUNNER"
   ],
   "text": "The Maharaja wants you. Bring the letter.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Your brother has a quick mind. I like his joke about the sky and the Peshwa.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He does not have to face either directly. That makes jokes easier.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The Maratha confederacy is a storm with many centres. What interests me is this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "\"Conquer him before he grows too strong.\"",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do you think they will try?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If they think you are weak, yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If they think you are useful, they will keep you as you are, so long as you do not interfere with their plans. They have many enemies closer to home.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "And you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If they sent a letter with your brother, ordering you back under their banner, what would you do?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I would read the letter. I would weigh it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I would remember Goa. I would remember the storm. I would remember Colachel. Then I would choose.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You do not say which way you would choose.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Because I am not arrogant enough to think I know what the world will look like when that letter arrives.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If it arrives.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Honest. I prefer honest answers to pious lies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Understand this, Ananthan. You are useful to me because you are Maratha and because you are Padmini's son.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You can speak to men in Pune in a way my other nobles cannot.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You can make them fear and respect this kingdom, or you can make them see it as prey.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you ever choose the second, we will stand on opposite sides of a very narrow river.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you choose the first, you will have my gratitude. For whatever that is worth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "For now, you stay. The north will have to wait its turn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You cannot stand with one foot in each river forever. At some point you must choose which current to let carry you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "What if I cling to a rock between them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Then you drown slower. But you still drown.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Your hills call you. Your king here calls you. You are flattered to be wanted by both.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Neither will mourn very long if they must cut you loose.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have a cruel tongue.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "No. I have an impatient one.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Besides, do not let that silver chain weigh you down with too much hope.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Even if you have a tharavadu now, I am a Princess of Velinadu. We do not marry commoners, Nagoji. Even ones who think they have found a root.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "This goes to Nashik. To the house of Ramji Sawant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "sowcar"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SOWCAR"
   ],
   "text": "It is a long road, Karyakkar. Roads have bandits. Bandits have hunger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "sowcar"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It travels by your hundi. Your paper is worth more than gold on the road.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "sowcar"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SOWCAR"
   ],
   "text": "And this?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "sowcar"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "This travels with it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "sowcar"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SOWCAR"
   ],
   "text": "It will reach them. My word is iron.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "See that it is.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The letter is sent?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And the man who wrote it?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He stayed at the market. He is not coming back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Then who stands before me?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan Pillai.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Welcome home, Ananthan Pillai. Dinner is ready. Do not make us wait.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  }
 ]
}